Error [E0989]: this `comptime if` condition can't be known at compile time
  --> tests/ui/comptime_if_noncomptime_cond.jet:3:17
    |
  3 |     comptime if x {
    |                 ^
 Why: a `comptime if` condition must be a comptime expression — a `comptime` binding, a literal, or a pure function call with comptime arguments (D-WHEN1)
 Fix: use a `comptime` binding: `comptime FLAG = …; comptime if FLAG { … }`
